  "document": "Andy Summers\nAndrew James Somers( born 31 December 1942 from Poulton- le- Fylde, Lancashire), known professionally as Andy Summers, is an English singer and guitarist who was a member of the rock band the Police. He was inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame as a member of the band in 2003. Summers has recorded solo albums, collaborated with other musicians, composed film scores, and exhibited his photography in galleries."
